msgid "https://github.com/everett7623/wordpress-theme-rackora"
msgstr "https://github.com/everett7623/wordpress-theme-rackora"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A minimal, content-first block theme for independent publishing, knowledge bases, and technical writing. Quiet low-image layouts, light and dark color schemes, table of contents, code highlighting, and complete page-level SEO output."
msgstr "面向独立出版、知识库与技术写作的极简、内容优先区块主题：安静的低图片版式、明暗配色、文章目录、代码高亮与完整的页面级 SEO 输出。"

#. Author of the theme
